TI  - How will smart city production systems transform supply chain design: a product-level investigation
PY  - 2016
T2  - International Journal of Production Research
VL  - 54
IS  - 23
SP  - 7181
EP  - 7192
DO  - 10.1080/00207543.2016.1198057
